		(property "Note" "Two parts at once: the open-collector sensor's required pull-up AND the top half of the divider into the 3.3 V domain. Fed from the same PTC-protected group C node that excites the sensor, so a short takes the pull-up and the excitation down together rather than leaving a pull-up energising a dead sensor."
