		(property "Note" "Current limit. Conducts when the drop across the 56 ohm reaches one Vbe -- 0.65 V / 56 = 11.6 mA -- and steals the pass transistor's base drive. Without it a shorted 12V_GATE gets hFE x the full bias current from a 100 V rail."
